# Source art brought in to annotate. It is INPUT, not source: it belongs to whoever drew it, it is
# reproducible from the URL recorded in each set's `source` block, and once inside git history it never
# leaves. The files this repository produces are versioned; the pixel art they describe is not.
art-in/

